# Description: Detects uncommon "conhost" child processes. This could be a sign of "conhost" usage as a LOLBIN or potential process injection activity.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((parent_process_path="*\\conhost.exe") AND NOT (((process_path="*:\\Windows\\System32\\conhost.exe") OR (process_path="") OR (NOT process_path=*))) AND NOT ((Provider_Name="SystemTraceProvider-Process")))
